    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration experience that takes you deep into the heart of uncanny in-between spaces where reality unravels and sanity is questioned.  Uncover secret pathways, noclip through walls and delve into the liminal depths in search of escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/06b229275509bfd60e26debb9b731e90.poster.avif?t=1745189373\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/06b229275509bfd60e26debb9b731e90.webm?t=1745189373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/06b229275509bfd60e26debb9b731e90.mp4?t=1745189373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with the world you explore and unlock its secrets. Discover which laws of reality can be broken, but beware... This place doesn't want you to escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/7bbc2008dab86e1bafdc977621e43b69.poster.avif?t=1745189373\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/7bbc2008dab86e1bafdc977621e43b69.webm?t=1745189373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/7bbc2008dab86e1bafdc977621e43b69.mp4?t=1745189373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no monsters that chase you, but an inescapable dark presence watches your every move. The game has minimal UI, realistic environments and dark soundscapes to lose yourself in. Passages take many shapes and it's up to you to find the secret path of escape.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exploration experience that takes you deep into the heart of uncanny in-between spaces where reality unravels and sanity is questioned.  Uncover secret pathways, noclip through walls and delve into the liminal depths in search of escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/06b229275509bfd60e26debb9b731e90.poster.avif?t=1745189373\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/06b229275509bfd60e26debb9b731e90.webm?t=1745189373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/06b229275509bfd60e26debb9b731e90.mp4?t=1745189373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with the world you explore and unlock its secrets. Discover which laws of reality can be broken, but beware... This place doesn't want you to escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/7bbc2008dab86e1bafdc977621e43b69.poster.avif?t=1745189373\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/7bbc2008dab86e1bafdc977621e43b69.webm?t=1745189373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3336620/extras/7bbc2008dab86e1bafdc977621e43b69.mp4?t=1745189373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no monsters that chase you, but an inescapable dark presence watches your every move. The game has minimal UI, realistic environments and dark soundscapes to lose yourself in. Passages take many shapes and it's up to you to find the secret path of escape.</p>",
    "short_description": "Walking simulator, psychological horror. An eerie exploration experience that takes you deep into the heart of uncanny, in-between spaces where reality unravels. Uncover secret pathways and escape with your sanity intact.",
